        "title": "Pages deployment returning 502 Bad Gateway for Bismyth/pages",
        "body": "### Comment\n\nRepository: https://codeberg.org/Bismyth/pages\r\nPages URL: https://bismyth.codeberg.page/\r\nDefault Branch: pages\r\n\r\nProblem:\r\nThe Pages site is returning a 502 Bad Gateway. Testing the webhook pointing to 'https://bismyth.codeberg.page/' fails immediately with a 502 response from the upstream server.\r\n\r\nI have verified that the repository is public, index.html is present in the root folder, and the branch is correctly named 'pages'. Forcing a new commit did not trigger a successful build. It appears the deployment worker record for this site is stuck.\n\n",
